  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due Diligence Passporting &amp; Capacity strengthening - TSEQ Collective initiative (Violet)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TSEQ Collective initiative led by Age Intl, CA will be managing Violet&apos;s partnership.
The initiative is designed to accelerate localization in Syria, through governance and capacity strengthening with 20 grassroot civil society organizations of different sizes, whilst also contributing to sectoral learning and reform through the development of a policy paper on due diligence and capacity strengthening for CSOs. The initiative is co-designed to support and strengthen localised humanitarian response in Syria. Empowering CSOs to identify their own priorities through the Due Diligence tool that is most relevant to their size and needs and to lead on their own capacity strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
